# cerberus-term
===
 A GUI terminal multiplexer with remote control — native panes that run any CLI (Claude Code, Copilot, Codex, aider, a shell), your project's markdown rendered right in the pane, and approve, deny or prompt your AI sessions from your phone over Telegram. Notifications tested on macOS and Windows; Linux is unverified.
